sequenceDiagram
  participant Client
  participant Proxy
  participant Flask
  participant DB
  participant Outbox
  participant Celery
  participant Worker
  Client->>Proxy: HTTPS request
  Proxy->>Flask: Forward request
  Flask->>Flask: Authenticate, resolve tenant, authorize, validate
  Flask->>DB: Domain transaction + outbox row
  DB-->>Flask: Commit
  Flask-->>Client: 201/202 with resource or job ID
  Outbox->>Celery: Publish event
  Celery->>Worker: Execute async task
  Worker->>DB: Reload scoped records and claim idempotency
  Worker->>Worker: Call AI/provider adapter
  Worker->>DB: Persist outcome and audit
